1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:04,142
Forgot a timer, or spotted a mistake? Keep the record accurate.

2
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:14,795
Open Time entries and choose Add time. Select the project and work date, then enter a duration such as forty-five minutes and describe the work.

3
00:00:15,853 --> 00:00:25,405
Save the entry and check it in your monthly list. Manual durations and recorded sessions both contribute to the totals once they are finalised.

4
00:00:26,487 --> 00:00:38,037
Use the pencil to correct an entry and enter a reason. Editing only the description preserves the original timing. Change Duration only when the amount of time is wrong.

5
00:00:39,087 --> 00:00:49,581
Save the correction and review the updated entry. The previous value and your reason stay in the correction history. Team corrections require a server connection.

6
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:55,916
Useful descriptions, accurate durations and a clear record of corrections.
